      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Eric was providing a smooth process from start to finish, from quoting process to installation and after-support phase. Installation was good, his team arrived on time and did a wonderful installation, communicated what they do regularly, when there's something happening (1 of the tile broke and they honestly mentioned that). There's a slight hiccup since due to roof space, some of the panels weren't able to be installed in the north side as per the quotation hence required to be moved to south side of the roof, which will obviously perform less effective. However Eric kindly offered a good discount to the initial quote which was acceptable solution.Green & Save also helped organising the grid connection (I had to do the initial sign up with the new provider myself first) and their project manager was helpful and very responsive to my emails and/or questions.",
